WEBVTT

00:00:05.000 --> 00:00:17.000
Chris: Welcome to the menu pricing call. Our summary: The autumn menu needs prices that stay within our margin target.

00:00:20.000 --> 00:00:32.000
Chris: Croissant price is 3.20 pounds in the current draft.

00:00:42.000 --> 00:00:54.000
Ana: Finance asked for 3.50 pounds to protect margin on butter.

00:01:04.000 --> 00:01:16.000
Chris: The pumpkin loaf is priced at 4.10 pounds in every shop.

00:01:26.000 --> 00:01:38.000
Ana: Decision: Croissant price is still open: 3.20 or 3.50 pounds.

00:01:44.000 --> 00:01:56.000
Chris: Action: Agree the croissant price with finance. Please confirm by Friday.

00:01:59.000 --> 00:02:11.000
Chris: Action: Print the autumn menu boards. Please confirm by Friday.

00:02:14.000 --> 00:02:26.000
Ana: Thanks. Summary sent after the call.
